# evals/golden/ — real-conversation datasets for the ADHD-orb golden eval set.
#
# Isolated venv for this directory only (also matched by the repo-root .venv/ rule, but
# listed here explicitly so this directory documents its own boundary).
.venv/

# Raw downloaded archives/extracts (tarballs, zips, source CSVs/JSON shards) for every
# dataset. These are re-downloadable via each <dataset>/fetch_and_convert.py and are up to
# hundreds of MB uncompressed (e.g. SGD) — never commit them, only the sampled,
# converted conversations.jsonl (capped at ~2000 dialogues per dataset).
*/raw/
raw/

# AnnoMI specifically: the source repo (github.com/uccollab/AnnoMI) has no LICENSE file and
# no license statement in its README or cited papers. Per the hard rule "if a licence
# forbids redistribution, keep the script and do not commit the data", we treat "no licence
# found" the same way here — the converted file is produced locally so it can be counted
# and sanity-checked, but it must never be committed. See annomi/PROVENANCE.md.
annomi/conversations.jsonl
